          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of பூரிப்பு (pūrippu) is not settled; it is sometimes linked with Sanskrit words for filling, but our sources do not confirm the path."
            }
