              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "குதூகலம் — kutūkalam — \"glee; high spirits\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "விடுமுறை வந்ததால் குழந்தைகள் குதூகலமாக இருந்தார்கள். viṭumuṟai vantatāl kuḻantaikaḷ kutūkalamāka iruntārkaḷ. The holidays had come, so the children were in high spirits."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "With -ஆக and இரு: குதூகலமாக இருந்தார்கள், they were gleeful."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "குதூகலம் (kutūkalam) is borrowed from Sanskrit kutūhala, \"curiosity, eager interest\" (Monier-Williams); in Tamil it is high-spirited joy."
            }
          ]
